        "subject": "=[MEFai] Nouvelle demande de congé — {{$json.demande_id}}",
        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background:#f8fafc; padding:32px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:640px; margin:0 auto; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden;\">\n\n    <div style=\"padding:24px 28px; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#7c3aed; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.04em;\">\n        MEFai · RH\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 6px; color:#111827; font-size:24px;\">\n        Nouvelle demande de congé\n      </h2>\n\n      <p style=\"margin:0; color:#6b7280; font-size:14px;\">\n        Une nouvelle demande nécessite votre validation.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding:28px;\">\n\n      <div style=\"background:#f5f3ff; border:1px solid #ede9fe; border-radius:12px; padding:16px 18px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#6d28d9; font-weight:700;\">\n          RÉFÉRENCE\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:18px; color:#111827; font-weight:700; margin-top:4px;\">\n          {{$json.demande_id}}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:14px;\">\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 0; color:#6b7280;\">Employé</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 0; color:#111827; font-weight:600; text-align:right;\">\n            {{$json.employe_id}}\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 0; color:#6b7280;\">Type de congé</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 0; color:#111827; font-weight:600; text-align:right;\">\n            {{$json.type_conge}}\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 0; color:#6b7280;\">Date de début</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 0; color:#111827; font-weight:600; text-align:right;\">\n            {{$json.date_debut}}\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 0; color:#6b7280;\">Date de fin</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 0; color:#111827; font-weight:600; text-align:right;\">\n            {{$json.date_fin}}\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 0; color:#6b7280;\">Motif</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:10px 0; color:#111827; font-weight:600; text-align:right;\">\n            {{$json.motif}}\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n\n      <div style=\"margin-top:24px; padding:14px 16px; background:#fff7ed; border:1px solid #fed7aa; border-radius:10px;\">\n        <span style=\"color:#9a3412; font-size:13px; font-weight:700;\">\n          Statut : En attente de validation\n        </span>\n      </div>\n\n      <p style=\"margin:24px 0 0; color:#6b7280; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6;\">\n        Connectez-vous à l’Espace Manager MEFai pour consulter la demande et prendre une décision.\n      </p>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding:18px 28px; background:#f9fafb; border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb; color:#9ca3af; font-size:12px;\">\n      Notification automatique générée par MEFai · Assistant RH intelligent\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
